				(thickness 0.3)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "STACK-UP\nL1 Top signal / logic / local power\nL2 GND plane\nL3 VIN / power distribution\nL4 Power outputs / dirty signals\n\nNo blind vias.\nNo buried vias.\nNo microvias.\nNo via-in-pad unless specified."
